  "details": "As someone who communicates primarily through chatbox, I would really love if my avatar could react to the typing indicator.\n\nThrough OSC you can outwardly trigger the typing indicator to appear, but as far as I know there's no way to determine whether or not the user is typing regardless of where the typing is coming from.\n\nAn extra way to detect if a message has been successfully sent rather than cancelling typing would be awesome too. These two options would give mute VRChat users a really unique and fun way to express themselves during communication the same way others do with visemes.",
